        <profile name="Iron Fists" id="5be7-4349-72d7-b75b" hidden="false" typeId="058c-866b-6487-ccc4" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2ecd-b4ff-9e78-a8e2">The flesh of a Communicant Anti-Tank Hunter is as hard as iron, which makes their fists deadly weapons in their own right. A Communicant Anti-Tank Hunter can make a Melee Attack with the CLEAVE 2 Keyword even though it does not have a Melee Weapon. In addition, the Off-Hand Weapon modifier applies to the second attack.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
